              "type": "Annotation",
              "motivation": "commenting",
              "body": {
                "type": "TextualBody",
                "format": "text/html",
                "language": "en",
                "value": "<h3>Prepare the content on your controller</h3><p>Select the intended file or enter the message. Check the controller preview before you put it in front of the room.</p><p>The intended content is ready.</p><p><a href=\"https://vuthis.github.io/walkthrough-connect-phone-laptop-to-tv.html#step-4\">Follow this step in Connect a Phone or Laptop to TV Without HDMI: Interactive Walkthrough</a></p>"
              },
              "target": "https://vuthis.github.io/walkthrough-connect-phone-laptop-to-tv.iiif.json/canvas/2"
            },
            {
              "id": "https://vuthis.github.io/walkthrough-connect-phone-laptop-to-tv.iiif.json/note/5",
              "type": "Annotation",
              "motivation": "commenting",
              "body": {
                "type": "TextualBody",
                "format": "text/html",
                "language": "en",
                "value": "<h3>Choose Show now</h3><p>Tap Show now to put the selected content on the display. Keep your controls on the phone or laptop while the audience sees the result.</p><p>The room sees the selected content.</p><p><a href=\"https://vuthis.github.io/walkthrough-connect-phone-laptop-to-tv.html#step-5\">Follow this step in Connect a Phone or Laptop to TV Without HDMI: Interactive Walkthrough</a></p>"
              },
              "target": "https://vuthis.github.io/walkthrough-connect-phone-laptop-to-tv.iiif.json/canvas/2"
            },
            {
              "id": "https://vuthis.github.io/walkthrough-connect-phone-laptop-to-tv.iiif.json/note/6",
              "type": "Annotation",
              "motivation": "commenting",
              "body": {
                "type": "TextualBody",
                "format": "text/html",
                "language": "en",
                "value": "<h3>Follow the feature walkthrough</h3><p>Choose the PDF, slides, photos or screen-message guide below for the exact controls. Both devices can use different internet connections.</p><p>You can change the display from the controller.</p><p><a href=\"https://vuthis.github.io/walkthrough-connect-phone-laptop-to-tv.html#step-6\">Follow this step in Connect a Phone or Laptop to TV Without HDMI: Interactive Walkthrough</a></p>"
